    "sentences": [
      "Kaya packed her thin suitcase for the important school trip.",
      "The sky was cloudy, not snowy.",
      "She spent the morning in home economics class.",
      "Her brass band concert was next week.",
      "She only thought about playing dodge ball on the playground.",
      "A letter appeared on her desk, even showing a tiny mouse.",
      "It had a picture of a horse, a pig, and a scared monkey.",
      "She also saw sheep, chickens, and zebras.",
